* Wien bridge, R_i swept by a staircase (generated by the notebook)
XU1 N001 inv V+ V- Vout LM741
V1 V+ 0 15
V2 0 V- 15
Vr rctl 0 PWL(0 41)
Vtrig trig 0 PULSE(0 5 2.0 1u 1u 50m 1e6 1)
R1 Vout inv 90k
R2 inv a R=1k*V(rctl)
R3 N002 N001 2.17k
R4 0 N001 2.17k
C1 N001 0 1u
C2 Vout N002 1u
B1 a 0 V=0.001*white(5e2*time+{nseed})
.inc lm741.lib
.param Tstop=10 maxstep=0.1m nseed=0
.tran 0 {Tstop} 0 {maxstep}
.options plotwinsize=0
.save V(vout) V(trig) V(rctl) V(inv) V(a) I(R2)
.end
